From 5fd72d501dc2daf7ecd88c67c153b3a4e6ec260a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ALHIJRAH Canada Desk <noreply@careergate.us>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:34:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ALHIJRAH decision-support engine on OpenAI (server-side
 key/model); Groq removed

- lib/openai.ts: single client; OPENAI_API_KEY secret + OPENAI_MODEL variable; exact provider errors, no model substitution,
  response-model check; official-source web search (Canadian government domains) with dated citations
- Groq replaced everywhere (assistant, AI check/model list, client advisor, intake guide); settings show server config
- lib/decision-support.ts + /api/candidates/[id]/decision-support: compare up to 3 pathways against current official
  sources (per-requirement verified/unverified, page date, checked-on date), document check behind client AI authorization,
  AR/EN, encrypted draft reports, proposed follow-up tasks (staff approval)
- assistant: review/CV/cover-letter become staff-approved actions; search restricted to official sources
- case review: AR/EN output, official-source search
- /api/dashboard/priorities: overdue -> today -> waiting client requests -> inactive cases; desk + assistant use it
- tests: v22/decision-support (mocked), ai-live (real API, opt-in), updated office-hub/experience suites

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RQZ57XDCVxFYqkyqLENrNp
