+For each attached file (identified by the documentId text before it) report what the document visibly is, whether it matches its filed category, legibility, any expiry date exactly as printed (empty if none), and concrete issues (cropping, missing pages, mismatched names, expired, translation needed). Report only what is visible; never guess hidden content and never state that a document is authentic or approved.
